#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115124 :question/id #uuid "cd56314d-f45a-55be-9762-983fe507a1a0" :question/math-academy-id "e-6173" :question/problem "Given the system\n\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y &=4 \\\\ -4x+6y &=-8,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n\nwhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- The system is consistent dependent\n\n- The system has no solution\n\n- The system is consistent independent" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n\n$$\nM= \\left[ \\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 6 & -8\\end{array} \\right].\n$$\n\n\n\nUsing Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -4 & 6 & -8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y &=4 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\n\n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ form a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of just a single equation:\n\n$$\n2x -3y= 4\n$$\n\nThe basic variable is $x,$ and we have a free variable $y.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement I is true."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050240 :topic/id #uuid "38bc1722-543b-58cb-b448-fb93b0e623de" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073776} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073777} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186073778}] :topic/math-academy-id 493 :topic/next [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048343} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049754} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050258} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050673}] :topic/title "Systems of Equations With No Solutions and Infinitely Many Solutions"}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523192 :question-generator/id #uuid "ef6ae15d-64a0-50e2-9946-0e7f859493c2" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186115299.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115752 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4bdc967-dd67-5770-b3ba-57acb8064685" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438106} {:answer/id #uuid "16d63261-26fa-564b-9a02-813ef69df1ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438107}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4bdc967-dd67-5770-b3ba-57acb8064685" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438106} :answer-field/id #uuid "48e752bf-5559-502a-9c5a-30d89ae8707e" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439082} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bd14eb1a-54cf-5d73-9b08-8904377c5fc5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438108} {:answer/id #uuid "05ef1b8f-126b-56bb-bda0-423f87e55922" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438109}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "05ef1b8f-126b-56bb-bda0-423f87e55922" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438109} :answer-field/id #uuid "343b74aa-4317-53b2-a41d-750a92184a1b" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439083} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6e68484e-ebe2-513a-9922-2e5462de62b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438110} {:answer/id #uuid "7fe5eb6d-0b84-5bb3-929e-e95859bb6bf1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438111}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e68484e-ebe2-513a-9922-2e5462de62b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438110} :answer-field/id #uuid "9d0bc1ed-439f-55dd-983f-394748aacbef" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439084} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2101e299-5ba5-542f-afe5-9977bf810e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667998} {:answer/id #uuid "1d894366-7c4d-5b4b-88a1-cdbf8f4b1df7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667999}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2101e299-5ba5-542f-afe5-9977bf810e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667998} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b9dc4d9-9c6a-50d3-be8b-028225edec1c" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668276}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "402ab26a-a0df-5fc5-a264-b91a4c6d7d02" :question/math-academy-id "q-32242" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+2y &=6 \\\\ 2x-3y &=13 \\\\ 5x-y &=45\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 13 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 45\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 13 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 45\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 25 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 45\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+5{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 25 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 75\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-9){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 25 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -150\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-150,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115832 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e1eee681-520d-5d0a-802e-8d5b29c52974" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438296} {:answer/id #uuid "b2ace7b5-89a9-5ece-ad6b-0ce43e80a049" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438297}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b2ace7b5-89a9-5ece-ad6b-0ce43e80a049" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438297} :answer-field/id #uuid "07e35039-20ea-5f8c-9889-aaf209c08f8c" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439177} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c3d1f45-fc1a-5e10-a017-8a9199b3e295" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438298} {:answer/id #uuid "039beb6d-4028-5582-9983-702125a74145" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438299}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1c3d1f45-fc1a-5e10-a017-8a9199b3e295" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438298} :answer-field/id #uuid "168dcfad-47ff-5ee1-9214-61e870c730b0" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439178} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae82757c-5e4b-593d-84dd-aca1302ca366" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438300} {:answer/id #uuid "8f20a360-4b99-5b18-808c-9bab5fd09713" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438301}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae82757c-5e4b-593d-84dd-aca1302ca366" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438300} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b7ded78-a4d6-5805-8398-330746f91418" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439179} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f4d9eb17-ffed-5b56-ac2b-2647774ac17d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668068} {:answer/id #uuid "9bc2fdd6-b6bd-5b1d-a7f3-dd5d1162af93" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668069}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4d9eb17-ffed-5b56-ac2b-2647774ac17d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668068} :answer-field/id #uuid "ff5dd3c7-9210-550a-92dd-d40eb01e7944" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668311}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e80c83a9-9107-528b-af57-73287d15e8e2" :question/math-academy-id "q-42061" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y+z &=0 \\\\ -4x+6y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 6 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 6 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means we can to find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266113 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b502811a-4c5f-5724-8251-868a9480b1c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437878} {:answer/id #uuid "186cb15a-6c0f-5792-ab70-d713ad9b8faf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437879}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b502811a-4c5f-5724-8251-868a9480b1c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437878} :answer-field/id #uuid "6923725d-7900-549a-b06a-031593c2ab18" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438968} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c85fcf8a-4336-5666-8410-cf5fbbf94767" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437880} {:answer/id #uuid "df5f6c33-1e84-5f01-826a-31cd583e3cc7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437881}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df5f6c33-1e84-5f01-826a-31cd583e3cc7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437881} :answer-field/id #uuid "b513b48d-527b-559e-ab81-1586620cce1c" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438969} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5dc7bbd-657b-572d-b363-90d7302303fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437882} {:answer/id #uuid "50ff0389-893c-5201-a509-7c08e6f042f3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437883}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b5dc7bbd-657b-572d-b363-90d7302303fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437882} :answer-field/id #uuid "3cdaf77b-d135-55af-862e-3a96aaf3f51e" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438970} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed98a664-01d7-5ae0-b4ed-b816b4fda9f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667960} {:answer/id #uuid "0ff6cbd6-b592-558a-ba00-0409224cb898" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667961}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed98a664-01d7-5ae0-b4ed-b816b4fda9f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667960} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe4e1eec-1991-58e6-a18a-c03ea73fec67" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668257}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e7e2bc11-b1bf-5938-9267-7923a80ec463" :question/math-academy-id "q-131719" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+4y &=-1 \\\\ 2x+8y &=-2 \\\\ -3x-12y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 8 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -12 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x,$ and we have one free variable, $y.$ That means we can find $x$ in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266114 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ee5d0a5-5b6e-5e3a-bb66-236cc33d9fb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437902} {:answer/id #uuid "cf7df624-9f74-5695-9b6d-fb27e4a094f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437903}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cf7df624-9f74-5695-9b6d-fb27e4a094f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437903} :answer-field/id #uuid "db4757d3-9a84-5289-8aea-f7dd1a0eb7d1" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438980} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e0c899b-5aaf-5d75-b95e-4d89e3c89c6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437904} {:answer/id #uuid "c3bf7724-4756-5a58-8783-ffddc955e5ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437905}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e0c899b-5aaf-5d75-b95e-4d89e3c89c6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437904} :answer-field/id #uuid "cecffd33-a545-559e-827c-1ba60cf5059c" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438981} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c37efec2-77d1-5d31-9f9f-b29a46d81229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437906} {:answer/id #uuid "606ba1d3-bcb9-5739-b0cd-4e6ddfbaf77d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c37efec2-77d1-5d31-9f9f-b29a46d81229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437906} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f404ad7-7486-5271-8eb0-8c1a59d275b4" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438982} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bd0ddc71-3170-556d-88e1-c5190883286b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668355} {:answer/id #uuid "ae67e80c-50b2-5d23-9af4-a4babee4a6bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668356}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bd0ddc71-3170-556d-88e1-c5190883286b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668355} :answer-field/id #uuid "70c244ab-b0b7-556a-9798-94a84511aabe" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668755}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a61d7528-3ce2-5d0a-af23-11395074997a" :question/math-academy-id "q-131723" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y+z &=3 \\\\ -3x+3y-3z &=10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3 & -3 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 3 & -3 & 10\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 19\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=19,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266115 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2950aad8-79f5-5899-8a58-73ef75011ac0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437908} {:answer/id #uuid "e5392af0-e88c-54d2-80ee-57cd98c53027" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437909}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2950aad8-79f5-5899-8a58-73ef75011ac0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437908} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c277d28-497a-56d5-a22a-96f890c9bcb2" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438983} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f6df39b7-5e62-56b8-9a40-278abbcd76e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437910} {:answer/id #uuid "bca4b43d-938c-5727-96c4-77957ed09741" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437911}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f6df39b7-5e62-56b8-9a40-278abbcd76e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437910} :answer-field/id #uuid "08f93447-1292-5c0a-bb93-f3816eee426f" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438984} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f2755c5-437d-57df-9454-eef1a48617ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437912} {:answer/id #uuid "c54df87b-4111-522f-b91f-f1d60f8ca696" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437913}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c54df87b-4111-522f-b91f-f1d60f8ca696" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437913} :answer-field/id #uuid "89e1b2ad-cfef-519b-be03-81a8b9fde67c" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438985} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6fd2aee6-bbc7-5d60-978b-5663607e432b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668357} {:answer/id #uuid "fa67518c-7b3b-5e38-8c25-d388b7923f81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668358}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6fd2aee6-bbc7-5d60-978b-5663607e432b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668357} :answer-field/id #uuid "45aa11bd-b5c4-55d6-b571-41c7eb02390f" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668756}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "09e95d08-30a6-5777-a8a8-348db8bfab42" :question/math-academy-id "q-131724" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=2 \\\\ -3x-4y &=3 \\\\ 2x-4y &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 9 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -10 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-5,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186344956 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08768d96-6543-5057-b351-a7b1e161594f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438520} {:answer/id #uuid "e55197f9-beea-5d56-b568-4686a6fafa27" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438521}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08768d96-6543-5057-b351-a7b1e161594f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438520} :answer-field/id #uuid "c2c63157-7a5a-5373-8ad8-5fe787c42154" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439289} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e975cf8-6ced-5fcc-a167-0751d7c6d489" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438522} {:answer/id #uuid "6a5469f6-81d5-5ff6-93db-790de506e3a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438523}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e975cf8-6ced-5fcc-a167-0751d7c6d489" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438522} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc9e9ab2-76ef-5705-8ab7-acb52a0677b5" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439290} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2583daa7-3471-5757-b97e-74aae9210e3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438524} {:answer/id #uuid "56894365-ac99-5761-9fdc-76740ad849bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438525}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56894365-ac99-5761-9fdc-76740ad849bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438525} :answer-field/id #uuid "fd6825c7-6c00-5310-b8fa-2fe4fbc48f05" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439291}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "edc80b1b-d469-5071-b24d-3c90bb47fce6" :question/math-academy-id "q-74635" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+4y+3z &=0 \\\\ x+3y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first try to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & \\frac{3}{2} & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means that  we can find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186344957 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0d964555-6f83-5191-89db-fd72ffdf14c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438526} {:answer/id #uuid "ad751ae7-e25b-5406-b9e3-27ea4cbed2f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438527}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0d964555-6f83-5191-89db-fd72ffdf14c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438526} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae1a0230-4005-55bc-8174-e0944a31dd3e" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439292} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3be3c581-4293-5cdb-b090-f3c480d1c024" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438528} {:answer/id #uuid "89e07487-bb39-5368-bf53-e4b20abb5d72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438529}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "89e07487-bb39-5368-bf53-e4b20abb5d72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438529} :answer-field/id #uuid "d62a54fe-bb91-5a39-8c45-d4f5ab79b9a1" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439293} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4d848cbc-71b2-5e07-ad3c-93e27231b7c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438530} {:answer/id #uuid "82fdc104-5ebd-5054-99d2-64d287c3ea35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438531}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d848cbc-71b2-5e07-ad3c-93e27231b7c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438530} :answer-field/id #uuid "a883d2db-1de6-5620-afb1-bd3d06ab629d" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439294}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b0089d19-a4b5-5ec4-beaa-917a294458ba" :question/math-academy-id "q-74637" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+3y &=-1 \\\\ x-2y &=1 \\\\ -x-5y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first try to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -5 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=1 \\\\ 7y &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we get $y=-\\frac{3}{7}.$ Substituting this into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-2\\left(-\\frac{3}{7}\\right)=1\\,⟹\\,x=\\frac{1}{7}.\n$$\n\n \nSo, we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186363108 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d4b2e2b5-5692-5b4a-804f-7518ab214d08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437872} {:answer/id #uuid "3acb46da-0035-5f87-8672-6682f18cf559" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437873}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3acb46da-0035-5f87-8672-6682f18cf559" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437873} :answer-field/id #uuid "477f40a4-66af-5870-95c1-78ba941c5598" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438965} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8c7886ec-2b7c-5184-ba5d-a9cfd3f447ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437874} {:answer/id #uuid "1b86766c-211b-5526-8849-1753bc7e2812" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437875}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8c7886ec-2b7c-5184-ba5d-a9cfd3f447ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437874} :answer-field/id #uuid "76f4b7f4-de99-5ebc-a3fb-5f5fcbe4139b" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438966} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d52184b-23ff-5d3d-be0f-8e48b9e54a9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437876} {:answer/id #uuid "545708f8-29e7-5393-a590-6497da645a2c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437877}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d52184b-23ff-5d3d-be0f-8e48b9e54a9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437876} :answer-field/id #uuid "6b08613c-08bd-5a65-b4c6-d5cae5341709" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438967} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "230d301d-cd52-59f0-8164-f9d6e6d6aa03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669033} {:answer/id #uuid "15fe0392-248f-5ff4-a855-b9b2944ddc6e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669034}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "230d301d-cd52-59f0-8164-f9d6e6d6aa03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669033} :answer-field/id #uuid "f97dadb8-fd7f-558c-945b-4c4b5badb293" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669316}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e8de2435-5f56-5017-bf79-0b535c719854" :question/math-academy-id "q-131718" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y+z &=2 \\\\ -2x+7y+2z &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 7 & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 7 & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variables are $x$ and $y,$ and we have one free variable, $z.$ That means we can find $x$ and $y$ in terms of $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186364365 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e2d5a83-8718-5bdf-8eb3-db892e2ab5e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438532} {:answer/id #uuid "8eaaea36-3739-5e8a-a1ed-efc15f9bc00b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438533}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e2d5a83-8718-5bdf-8eb3-db892e2ab5e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438532} :answer-field/id #uuid "8efd7542-c77b-5d4d-8f60-5468e0925423" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439295} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "763f0363-fe65-5380-acc8-6965de771643" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438534} {:answer/id #uuid "be014b12-0b58-51d7-a7a3-d343e4554293" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438535}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "be014b12-0b58-51d7-a7a3-d343e4554293" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438535} :answer-field/id #uuid "1338d41d-dfae-54bb-ada6-b58b1d8cc303" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439296} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f48fb77e-36ef-5915-aaab-7df2660d984a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438536} {:answer/id #uuid "84b40478-f69c-539e-aac5-dd183a05b951" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438537}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f48fb77e-36ef-5915-aaab-7df2660d984a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438536} :answer-field/id #uuid "7051a40c-c2de-5375-95a6-8801b39f67c5" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439297}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "35b0295d-1e16-59cc-a201-696e791e0b7d" :question/math-academy-id "q-74643" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y &=8 \\\\ x+y &=-2 \\\\ x+\\frac{1}{2}y &=5.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first try to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 5\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 5\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 14 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 5\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{1}{2} & 7\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y &=-2 \\\\ -y &=14.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we get $y=-14.$ Substituting this into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+(-14)=-2\\,⟹\\,x=12.\n$$\n\n \nSo,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent.   \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400632 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "042c39af-05d4-5916-90ed-b2140841c0e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437884} {:answer/id #uuid "d6aa4878-727c-5081-a2f3-b05cc3779d8d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437885}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "042c39af-05d4-5916-90ed-b2140841c0e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437884} :answer-field/id #uuid "819cb8bf-d475-5f1d-b674-12ded903565c" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438971} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b9fab9a-732e-557e-89af-5c725e033f13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437886} {:answer/id #uuid "97937812-2266-5255-828e-cf5b3f4f3d5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437887}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b9fab9a-732e-557e-89af-5c725e033f13" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437886} :answer-field/id #uuid "0eda7076-17f5-56be-93f9-786bf1b9618f" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438972} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87384631-af80-5ad6-9a5c-bcc246f5f41d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437888} {:answer/id #uuid "46fcba46-2ddb-5e23-8878-f4e28acdd62f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437889}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46fcba46-2ddb-5e23-8878-f4e28acdd62f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437889} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa55c229-a084-546e-87ad-83ef1343ba34" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438973} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19caaa21-1924-5f34-bf64-11d9efbb6c3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669035} {:answer/id #uuid "4c09126d-8a68-536f-9a8b-012529fa611c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669036}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "19caaa21-1924-5f34-bf64-11d9efbb6c3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669035} :answer-field/id #uuid "461e6f2f-4d78-500f-9681-0f0e5f34ced2" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669317}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cd791ebf-f827-5528-ae25-d3ac1f74c5cc" :question/math-academy-id "q-131720" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-6y-2z &=4 \\\\ 3x-9y-3z &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -6 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -6 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -9 & -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x,$ and we have two free variables, $y$ and $z.$ That means we can find $x$ in terms of $y$ and $z.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400639 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf929f6a-e145-57f9-9489-b8af5e174866" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437890} {:answer/id #uuid "7f26eb37-aeba-52b6-8b95-caafc52f3431" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437891}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f26eb37-aeba-52b6-8b95-caafc52f3431" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437891} :answer-field/id #uuid "2fbdbbd8-b352-5675-a10c-aa7c8880cb1e" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438974} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70be4c05-8842-5d93-9933-6a01768e4c37" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437892} {:answer/id #uuid "6cec419e-f6b4-51c0-ae9e-deed2e858fc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437893}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "70be4c05-8842-5d93-9933-6a01768e4c37" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437892} :answer-field/id #uuid "51c120d2-aebb-5e91-8e2f-ef0869ec4dd4" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438975} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "43f8ee53-d356-528d-9a82-f385997b6c3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437894} {:answer/id #uuid "262383e4-8fe8-5d1c-ad11-c487ac71bc1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437895}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "43f8ee53-d356-528d-9a82-f385997b6c3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437894} :answer-field/id #uuid "07a2a3d4-474a-5d37-b1a5-05837e60f654" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438976} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6bd79b88-af3a-5863-9c9c-2f3f1d5e44a7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669037} {:answer/id #uuid "f2735887-99de-543f-aed7-0e72e76203db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669038}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6bd79b88-af3a-5863-9c9c-2f3f1d5e44a7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669037} :answer-field/id #uuid "94e01891-307f-5863-9e93-52d1282eb40d" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669318}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b9b47374-5548-52b6-9b51-17d923fcd37b" :question/math-academy-id "q-131721" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 3x+7y &=1 \\\\ -2x-4y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 7 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 7 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ y &=4.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=4$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=-9.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400646 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b14622e0-0a8b-52f6-8bf8-44a04ea90e2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437896} {:answer/id #uuid "422e0298-fb2d-5c6d-a4af-8cba072754ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437897}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b14622e0-0a8b-52f6-8bf8-44a04ea90e2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437896} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ddef766-7f45-5b44-b48d-737353d4be25" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438977} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "522be474-9268-5719-9b67-fa3c52635318" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437898} {:answer/id #uuid "37b81bb5-685b-583b-8db4-0245d173fc7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437899}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "37b81bb5-685b-583b-8db4-0245d173fc7d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437899} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0b79b55-bd9c-5274-8736-1fa18bb4e7d7" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438978} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63da7652-c50c-579a-9313-44ed8eac188b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437900} {:answer/id #uuid "715c6b27-3b25-5248-a7ad-aceb0fe78ca6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437901}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63da7652-c50c-579a-9313-44ed8eac188b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437900} :answer-field/id #uuid "a893b756-f994-5e2f-ab56-a98d5a543109" :answer-field/key "The system has no solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438979} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed4c4298-c274-5506-95ba-2e40145b01d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669039} {:answer/id #uuid "80e6770a-2c73-54a6-b26e-9ebc40660d80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669040}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed4c4298-c274-5506-95ba-2e40145b01d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669039} :answer-field/id #uuid "ac790e8c-7dda-5424-ab85-bfe6b93ff17c" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186669319}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4890e1ff-ed9a-5558-acd1-bcef01439e04" :question/math-academy-id "q-131722" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-3y &=6 \\\\ -2x+y &=-3 \\\\ 4x-4y &=8.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -4 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :=-{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y &=2 \\\\ y &=-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=-1$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=1.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186402763 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e6873b1-0d04-54c4-a516-3393f091ca8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438290} {:answer/id #uuid "cf136178-b995-530b-bb4f-ee1711feaab9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438291}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e6873b1-0d04-54c4-a516-3393f091ca8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438290} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f126748-e572-518c-b374-65fb20a3785e" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439174} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58ee750b-7fc4-5d76-a8fd-41226a7f5ad1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438292} {:answer/id #uuid "23ff6b9a-302b-5629-8e07-bc20b267963c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438293}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "58ee750b-7fc4-5d76-a8fd-41226a7f5ad1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438292} :answer-field/id #uuid "db15201f-7938-57e0-8d64-2e3e68d9b2f2" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439175} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "db32e8d6-cfbf-5975-ae7e-91c6447ca478" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438294} {:answer/id #uuid "a53b68f3-fc73-544a-93b7-5353580edb77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438295}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a53b68f3-fc73-544a-93b7-5353580edb77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438295} :answer-field/id #uuid "9847730a-03c8-54a9-b1d7-d557810eefed" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439176}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1a930b2a-2578-5145-8e40-06b6cab16ba9" :question/math-academy-id "q-42020" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ 3x+y &=3 \\\\ -2x+y &=-2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=2,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403787 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ed3c728-986a-5b3f-ab57-0020cb435ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438514} {:answer/id #uuid "72c05b38-661e-55ef-b895-991dd965f68d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438515}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3ed3c728-986a-5b3f-ab57-0020cb435ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438514} :answer-field/id #uuid "d5f63264-b18f-5fb9-8709-61b443e3ce15" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439286} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a9ad7d4-df0d-5491-9263-1cfec2f1523b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438516} {:answer/id #uuid "0cfc1f4e-c211-54e2-8df0-f80bdf080bed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438517}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1a9ad7d4-df0d-5491-9263-1cfec2f1523b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438516} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0678042-ac90-54b5-926f-6259f946ee55" :answer-field/key "The system has a unique solution" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439287} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c32dbf70-7f15-517a-9383-074f32bf4f01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438518} {:answer/id #uuid "b90a004e-1b26-5348-ab56-1dd54d767fcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438519}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b90a004e-1b26-5348-ab56-1dd54d767fcc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438519} :answer-field/id #uuid "98fa2d2a-8e07-54bb-bb31-70f2215b776f" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439288}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a8971116-e24d-5808-9b29-a50e168511e5" :question/math-academy-id "q-74634" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y &=-1 \\\\ 2x-4y &=3 \\\\ x+y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we will first try to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\frac{9}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=\\frac{9}{2},$ and it has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186492840 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c122c68-ba85-506a-9b5d-b7e8d41f11b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492400} {:answer/id #uuid "90746f9d-5a52-5223-86f2-eebad7cce602" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492502} {:answer/id #uuid "a00e12c1-efd1-5bb1-8807-973d94c98793" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492536} {:answer/id #uuid "af7e5af6-3e33-5368-823c-3062f7002694" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492568} {:answer/id #uuid "fcccf2b5-4696-5f4a-92c9-3b29f694860e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492701}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "af7e5af6-3e33-5368-823c-3062f7002694" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492568} :answer-field/id #uuid "83ab4b9b-dc34-5dc7-8a1e-ba7fb0076d92" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186492760}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "22d64530-5ce7-515c-aafe-c528e2fc812f" :question/math-academy-id "q-74834" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-4y &=-1 \\\\ 2x-7y &=0 \\\\ -4x+15y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is consistent independent\n\nII. The system has no solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 15 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 15 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -4 & 15 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-4y &=-1 \\\\ y &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=2$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=7.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement I is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523101 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46fe9d86-8a7b-5b31-9f33-352086d9b0be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523118} {:answer/id #uuid "58a2e68c-7ee5-5893-a320-e4d59782d97a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523127}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46fe9d86-8a7b-5b31-9f33-352086d9b0be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523118} :answer-field/id #uuid "072bdae2-59da-58c7-af80-28f3f2f9aae7" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523094} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02336600-7104-5fb9-9b31-cae1a52518dc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523092} {:answer/id #uuid "547d116e-af59-5ba8-b479-146d79b8a167" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523124}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "547d116e-af59-5ba8-b479-146d79b8a167" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523124} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c4297dc-f995-5396-8e9e-d024c65ce177" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523113} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "141e0203-23b8-5619-a962-5626778a971c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523103} {:answer/id #uuid "6fb4a988-bcd2-5b80-a37e-65bc083843a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523137}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "141e0203-23b8-5619-a962-5626778a971c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523103} :answer-field/id #uuid "60631e67-ec0e-5269-b67b-3fd99562c886" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523131}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1080e551-06cd-5714-8bdc-170d1f4b1992" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=0 \\\\ x+4y &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e065480-c3c7-5a97-80dd-f851baccc4cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523108} {:answer/id #uuid "63fa15da-a612-551e-bc84-28195f146d91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523135}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63fa15da-a612-551e-bc84-28195f146d91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523135} :answer-field/id #uuid "95720269-0a64-5442-8ea6-fada3caa3f3d" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523154} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a075d6f9-6a6b-521c-9a45-cefd6406a87f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523157} {:answer/id #uuid "a3d89df8-a864-501a-978f-d1b4c908a594" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523159}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a075d6f9-6a6b-521c-9a45-cefd6406a87f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523157} :answer-field/id #uuid "d4f4634b-41cc-5f87-b51b-46f0fed4e546" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523175} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c51d359e-c96e-568d-a08a-cc6a5975c003" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523169} {:answer/id #uuid "d80969b7-edb9-54aa-9415-47b2ca6fa4d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523176}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d80969b7-edb9-54aa-9415-47b2ca6fa4d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523176} :answer-field/id #uuid "da426b62-5fc6-56a5-92f1-825ae424ef78" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523179}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2c37a8ce-9961-58b3-83eb-74946c8f3663" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-2z &=-4 \\\\ x+3y &=-8 \\\\ x+y-4z &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(1){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=-3,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523119 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "92f5b3ce-9f77-555e-a32f-418bc4e4ae3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523151} {:answer/id #uuid "9552d211-6758-511e-9dd2-695af0b42a16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523153}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "92f5b3ce-9f77-555e-a32f-418bc4e4ae3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523151} :answer-field/id #uuid "178e2ad7-57e9-5728-a5d6-b6e9f1ddc32e" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523106} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1127203c-eb67-5f24-9963-9f6c74e2e286" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523102} {:answer/id #uuid "7b3c86e8-fe67-5803-979e-32951465e4ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523140}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1127203c-eb67-5f24-9963-9f6c74e2e286" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523102} :answer-field/id #uuid "8925e95f-c16a-5da9-bc62-4ffcfe2c9609" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523144} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b6f9e16b-ee78-5f24-a114-9509d560608d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523162} {:answer/id #uuid "ffb07647-4604-59aa-a0cf-ee179bfdcceb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523191}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ffb07647-4604-59aa-a0cf-ee179bfdcceb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523191} :answer-field/id #uuid "d98057d3-cab1-5021-9e07-c30835639d6d" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523177}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "482e6d01-f9bf-525e-86f9-c527dca5de7f" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-5 \\\\ -2x+6y &=10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 6 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 6 & 10\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. Here there is one free variable, $y$. Therefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523120 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4094b2ed-2795-574f-9bb3-fb2c83ecb51c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523117} {:answer/id #uuid "5f0b8de0-9754-5abb-bbaa-1a2488a781e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523129}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4094b2ed-2795-574f-9bb3-fb2c83ecb51c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523117} :answer-field/id #uuid "25d63ecc-0162-52f1-8496-c91465d5168f" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523109} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b4a9eea-9608-50ab-9333-020c18e9ce1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523121} {:answer/id #uuid "f60437e2-7dd6-546f-9828-b80e9f59a8e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523188}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4b4a9eea-9608-50ab-9333-020c18e9ce1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523121} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ddd758a-c236-567f-9e01-d88d008f82a6" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523114} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87d21643-01b3-5b36-833a-4904b0c0d2ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523143} {:answer/id #uuid "f4fe98d8-0f7b-5c9d-87ac-6ff411f4142c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523187}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4fe98d8-0f7b-5c9d-87ac-6ff411f4142c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523187} :answer-field/id #uuid "8dc94f57-6ef6-5b16-95f9-1ae9415ced68" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523148}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "48bd3d4c-5e94-556e-bb2a-82b8de48db17" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+2z &=0 \\\\ -2x-y-7z &=-2 \\\\ 2x+11z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 7 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523134 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1df67eee-8e7e-5eb7-ba3b-02df7c2b88d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523107} {:answer/id #uuid "edeeea6a-d422-56c3-b686-ec4bc3cfaaf5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523182}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "edeeea6a-d422-56c3-b686-ec4bc3cfaaf5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523182} :answer-field/id #uuid "7506832c-a1c4-534a-b2e6-d51bb3a21471" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523138} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f63a9e5-2946-52bc-8fdc-8b775647cf8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523130} {:answer/id #uuid "613155d7-d7de-5a5a-91c3-ac538369b356" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523133}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5f63a9e5-2946-52bc-8fdc-8b775647cf8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523130} :answer-field/id #uuid "ac0ae869-8ade-5317-96c1-5e22aec5b834" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523160} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "53e8ac69-39e1-5dfb-b044-65b188ea3777" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523123} {:answer/id #uuid "912e1233-1f11-5ad2-85d3-0096b74affbb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523150}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "53e8ac69-39e1-5dfb-b044-65b188ea3777" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523123} :answer-field/id #uuid "f44f1c65-b30b-551b-a69a-7f4cd3ad8965" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523184}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "636c60f0-5dc2-592a-9ada-f299790fa243" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+z &=5 \\\\ x+2y+2z &=7 \\\\ x+3y+5z &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51be9dbd-7ee6-56c1-a547-5903d2a1b3e7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523122} {:answer/id #uuid "f4d7767c-aca7-50f4-90dc-f407ea0d7a3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523186}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4d7767c-aca7-50f4-90dc-f407ea0d7a3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523186} :answer-field/id #uuid "996ab691-0a7b-56e9-804a-a2787a923077" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523156} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a23b4315-1a65-506a-8c02-738beed7aaa6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523158} {:answer/id #uuid "bb33e391-198c-5529-9d5b-397721de092c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523164}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a23b4315-1a65-506a-8c02-738beed7aaa6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523158} :answer-field/id #uuid "d28f612b-3349-546c-9210-2a56396e5c6f" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523173} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08e08fdf-8af3-5a6d-a236-96fcf159b0f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523095} {:answer/id #uuid "60e8b807-93c5-5642-bfc7-4739a9cf92c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523132}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08e08fdf-8af3-5a6d-a236-96fcf159b0f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523095} :answer-field/id #uuid "f478684b-108b-505b-8b25-f8e1f9defb6d" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523185}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "8a8ea6cd-37c6-57a9-b6bb-655208ae0dae" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-z &=1 \\\\ 2x+5y &=7 \\\\ -2x-3y+5z &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -2 & -3 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -2 & -3 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ -2 & -3 & 5 & 6\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523149 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b71e9efd-4041-5353-b773-e73d4943b58e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523163} {:answer/id #uuid "c040c9e9-b2b2-5290-9279-e6d8a22bf949" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523167}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c040c9e9-b2b2-5290-9279-e6d8a22bf949" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523167} :answer-field/id #uuid "0c161978-1b18-5f69-ab37-c6a064914aa4" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523097} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1070f3b9-edc1-598f-9822-27e3abfa3c58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523100} {:answer/id #uuid "86e55745-a3ef-551c-a3b4-ce4d34f0d892" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523142}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1070f3b9-edc1-598f-9822-27e3abfa3c58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523100} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a48fbc9-4e49-5abc-8cad-5f489b22b567" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523145} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ca331de-6d7a-5bec-913c-999c56c3d275" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523098} {:answer/id #uuid "768483dd-8204-52e1-a40b-ab97ef2fad60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523139}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "768483dd-8204-52e1-a40b-ab97ef2fad60" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523139} :answer-field/id #uuid "96339ae7-9e2a-597d-b5f3-d761fa172570" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523155}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8e31a150-29e9-5dea-94ac-a18aad26fe11" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y &=1 \\\\ 2x+4y &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523165 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56e13df2-cbbc-5122-a312-3d4718cfd2d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523126} {:answer/id #uuid "8ce05a37-3f4d-53ca-9976-cf02a4b3a3bb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523147}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56e13df2-cbbc-5122-a312-3d4718cfd2d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523126} :answer-field/id #uuid "2629fa4f-103c-5153-9f74-91ca5c93439c" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523110} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "554b6c18-e491-5f95-965d-fa5a2bd9d88d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523125} {:answer/id #uuid "f97645eb-31df-5037-9f30-9be5b18f44ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523189}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f97645eb-31df-5037-9f30-9be5b18f44ce" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523189} :answer-field/id #uuid "5bacc81c-a202-5de7-91a7-ef4e2100ffe9" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523128} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1682be06-115f-54ff-a73b-9b589617e8f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523105} {:answer/id #uuid "27fd6cae-d564-59e2-aa3f-8a705ed55e02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523111}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1682be06-115f-54ff-a73b-9b589617e8f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523105} :answer-field/id #uuid "b680bc94-e35d-5672-8a29-61a6ce96c60b" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523161}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bb7d6994-e998-58f7-aa63-248113b6349d" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y &=4 \\\\ -x &=-8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -8\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(1){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523181 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9392a4b7-e0c1-50c1-a200-9aea19b85ad8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523152} {:answer/id #uuid "c54d1d3c-4700-5389-9521-819eca5efa3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523170}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c54d1d3c-4700-5389-9521-819eca5efa3a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523170} :answer-field/id #uuid "14a0dd8b-1651-52fe-a379-fa629f0b62ac" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523104} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bc35ea2c-b5fa-5a21-af8c-52f26ca8f62f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523166} {:answer/id #uuid "d9a8d720-eb68-5c11-a4f9-701068036d21" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523178}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bc35ea2c-b5fa-5a21-af8c-52f26ca8f62f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523166} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f23ed57-d37c-5347-b6fc-2f6d63d7a37b" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523115} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7fa07bf6-b3cb-5d2d-8a9f-a191e0b6e0f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523141} {:answer/id #uuid "c5a5ef39-054c-5b8e-b9af-e036a4693bb2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523171}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7fa07bf6-b3cb-5d2d-8a9f-a191e0b6e0f5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523141} :answer-field/id #uuid "c354c352-0b95-52ed-8029-4f2c45821f10" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523168}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ec9855f3-8df8-5de8-aa96-4a294a867b64" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y-3z &=5 \\\\ 2x-5y-9z &=10 \\\\ 2x-5y-9z &=10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -9 & 10 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -9 & 10 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. Here there is one free variable, $z$. Therefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent dependent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523190 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "652676ed-c325-50b3-9370-c0907c671f47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523136} {:answer/id #uuid "f3e7efd8-3b15-55b0-a40f-7c34b7c76512" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523183}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f3e7efd8-3b15-55b0-a40f-7c34b7c76512" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523183} :answer-field/id #uuid "04645717-bac8-5e0f-80de-5dc8a6e34e04" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523093} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a148d48-fb64-5d16-b8f9-19a6596fe811" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523096} {:answer/id #uuid "3abd678a-230b-520d-a0dd-63dc44fa005b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523116}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0a148d48-fb64-5d16-b8f9-19a6596fe811" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523096} :answer-field/id #uuid "cfcb9672-726a-595a-b7dd-19a4952a0aab" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent independent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523172} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fcc01c5-0bb3-5828-940a-30086cb2d945" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523099} {:answer/id #uuid "d3e45317-561e-5c27-9374-58cfdb78546e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523174}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3e45317-561e-5c27-9374-58cfdb78546e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523174} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc3eaf4f-09ba-503b-a672-da707e643826" :answer-field/key "The system is consistent dependent" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523180}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fe67b029-391e-51be-a295-1e535d93c516" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-3 \\\\ -2x-4y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & -4 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-3,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is inconsistent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186569976 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a116b39-7748-5b97-8286-409d809e42cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569501} {:answer/id #uuid "33822258-829b-5084-adb7-be68d8b35521" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569518} {:answer/id #uuid "4ae92370-bb9c-5f64-acc7-34346d0fb34d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569546} {:answer/id #uuid "4eac203e-2b67-5cbd-b5f3-2f4c25980863" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569554} {:answer/id #uuid "b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569720}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b11d6ce5-b8fc-5e47-ad56-2ad45b30686f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569720} :answer-field/id #uuid "eda18abf-1e9e-51ea-a1af-55bc7948bea6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186569945}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2f4a72f8-3bd3-5788-9d12-62ca6f611891" :question/math-academy-id "q-74636" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+y &=-1 \\\\ 2x+3y &=3 \\\\ -x-4y &=-3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is inconsistent\n\nII. The system has a unique solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -4 & -3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-1,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement I is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580307 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ac534ba-d100-5a5e-8702-0f756592a2db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186579723} {:answer/id #uuid "51736099-5405-59a0-87a2-8b3919ecb09d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I  and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186579816} {:answer/id #uuid "a09671f0-a00b-5d23-9ec6-0d24047ea3d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186579950} {:answer/id #uuid "a1a3e3b3-60a8-5b5d-a647-029c10902154" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186579955} {:answer/id #uuid "c0df8475-06cf-5287-be0f-be13636e54fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II  and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186580000}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a09671f0-a00b-5d23-9ec6-0d24047ea3d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186579950} :answer-field/id #uuid "2fb98030-4b48-56b4-b82e-e960bfec0072" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186580139}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d63c26b5-97c7-566b-af91-3b869e17916f" :question/math-academy-id "q-74638" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y &=-3 \\\\ -6x-4y &=6,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is consistent independent\n\nII. The system is consistent dependent\n\nIII. The system has no solution" :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find the solution to the system. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -6 & -4 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to reduced row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -6 & -4 & 6\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y &=-3 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ form a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of just a single equation:\n\n$$\n3x+2y=-3\n$$\n\nThe basic variable is $x,$ and we have a free variable $y.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y.$ \n\nTherefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement II is true."}] :knowledge-point/title "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"}]}
